==Description==

The '''Std ViewIvStereoOff''' command switches off stereo view mode in the active [[3D_View|3D View]].

==Usage==

# Select the {{MenuCommand|View → Stereo → [[Image:Std_ViewIvStereoOff.svg|16px]] Stereo Off}} option from the menu.

==Scripting==

See [[Std_ViewIvStereoRedGreen#Scripting|Std ViewIvStereoRedGreen]].


